      "mergedPostDetails": "A couple of the users in my community found that if you see someone wearing a public avatar and their \"Allow Avatar Cloning\" is off, you can still clone or favorite the avatar by viewing the Avatar details page for the avatar. Here is a video example they sent over. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDgnozPYM8Q",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Workaround for having avatar cloning off",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "629062b22874050b71efd437",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just realized this canny was already here. I had made a duplicate without realizing. Issue is marked as 'Tracked Internally' though.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1202-able-to-force-clone-public-avatars-off-others-regardless-if-cloning-is-turn",
